# 第六百五十一部　反射伙伴看到的是镜像同构世界

令：

$$
\boxed{
\rho^\sharp=J\rho=1-\overline\rho.
}
\tag{651.1}
$$

completed \(\xi\) 的函数方程和实结构给出：

$$
\boxed{
\xi
\left(
\rho^\sharp-\overline z
\right)
=
\overline{
\xi(\rho+z)
}.
}
\tag{651.2}
$$

若：

$$
a_k(\rho)
=
\frac{\xi^{(k)}(\rho)}{k!},
$$

则：

$$
\boxed{
a_k(\rho^\sharp)
=
(-1)^k
\overline{a_k(\rho)}.
}
\tag{651.3}
$$

所以归一化局部世界满足：

$$
\boxed{
\mathcal G_{\rho^\sharp}
(-\overline z)
=
\overline{
\mathcal G_\rho(z)
}.
}
\tag{651.4}
$$

